### 1. 로그인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "testuser",
  "password": "1234"
}

### 2. JWT 없이 사용자 API 접근
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/user

### 3. JWT로 사용자 API 접근
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/user
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiI0MSIsInJvbGUiOiJVU0VSIiwiaWF0IjoxNzkxOTYxMzgyLCJleHAiOjE3OTE5NjE0NDJ9.WYalICzuexeMrCJGr-A4fp37MpPn9ZkP86xoq9SjIrg

### 4. USER 토큰으로 관리자 API 접근
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/test
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJzdWIiOiI0MSIsInJvbGUiOiJVU0VSIiwiaWF0IjoxNzkxOTYxMzgyLCJleHAiOjE3OTE5NjE0NDJ9.WYalICzuexeMrCJGr-A4fp37MpPn9ZkP86xoq9SjIrg